From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 12:01:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 102/225] soh: rename func_8006C5A8 -> Curve_Interpolate

Name source: zeldaret/oot.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 soh/include/functions.h                | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data.c           | 3 ++-
 soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data_skelanime.c | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index c3f7fff4f..3146a2eca 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -882,7 +882,7 @@ void Flags_UnsetAllEnv(PlayState* play);
 void Flags_SetEnv(PlayState* play, s16 flag);
 void Flags_UnsetEnv(PlayState* play, s16 flag);
 s32 Flags_GetEnv(PlayState* play, s16 flag);
-f32 func_8006C5A8(f32 target, TransformData* transData, s32 refIdx);
+f32 Curve_Interpolate(f32 target, TransformData* transData, s32 refIdx);  // was func_8006C5A8 [oot]
 void SkelCurve_Clear(SkelAnimeCurve* skelCurve);
 s32 SkelCurve_Init(PlayState* play, SkelAnimeCurve* skelCurve, SkelCurveLimbList* limbListSeg,
                    TransformUpdateIndex* transUpdIdx);
diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data.c b/soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data.c
index 481ff686c..039bfc633 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_fcurve_data.c
